# reversing-mcp — Cursor Rules

## Commands
```powershell
uv run python -m reversing_mcp.server    # Start server
uv run pytest tests/ -q                  # Run tests
uv run ruff check src/ tests/            # Lint
```

## Architecture
FastMCP 3.4+ server with 13 tools for static binary analysis (Ghidra, radare2, binwalk) and Directmedia format reversing. Backend on 10751.

## Tool Discovery
All tools are in `server.py` with `@mcp.tool()` decorators. Implementations in `analyzers.py`. Use `help(topic="all")` for full listing.

## Code Standards
- Ruff Python linting (line length 120)
- No `print()` in prod code; use `logger` from `logging_config.py`
- No bare `except:` without logging
- Type hints on all functions
